theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 12
text = "[ TRANSMISSION RECEIVED ]

LindOS Alpha 0.1

Welcome, Operator.

The world you see is not the real world.

Beneath the surface of everyday life exists a hidden system of control, an artificial reality maintained by powerful entities that manipulate information, identity, and truth itself. Most people never realize they are trapped within it.

A few do.

As an Operator working through LindOS, you are tasked with locating, assisting, and extracting individuals who show signs of awakening. Every connection, every terminal, and every breached system may lead to someone who is ready to discover the truth.

Your missions come from a mysterious figure known only as ROGAN.

Little is known about him. Some believe he was among the first to break free. Others claim he still operates within the system itself. Whatever the truth may be, his network spans the globe and his intelligence is rarely wrong.

Through encrypted channels, ROGAN will provide contracts, investigations, infiltrations, and rescue operations. Success will expand your access to tools, networks, and knowledge. Failure may leave innocent minds trapped within the system.

Alpha 0.1 Features:

• LindOS operating system simulation
• Interactive terminal environment
• Basic filesystem navigation
• Early hacking mechanics
• Initial mission framework
• Secure communications from ROGAN
• Prototype network systems

Known Issues:

• Placeholder content and artwork
• Incomplete applications
• Missing mission chains
• Temporary balancing
• Experimental features in testing

This release represents the first step into a much larger world.

The system is watching.
Stay hidden.
Trust no source without verification.

And remember...

Not everyone wants to be saved.

Status: ALPHA
Version: 0.1

End Transmission."

